  "notes": "Issued with a custom printed credits inner sleeve.\n\nPrinted on back cover:\nProduced ... for Event Horizon Enterprises.\nSleeve \u00a91981 RCA Ltd.\nManufactured and distributed in Canada by: / Fabriqu\u00e9 et distribu\u00e9 au Canada par: RCA Inc., 101 Duncan Mill Road, Don Mills, Ontario M3B 1Z3\n\nPrinted on spine:\n[Ever Reddy logo] Printed in Canada\n\nPrinted on Side A label:\n\u2117 1980 1981 RCA Limited\nManufactured in Canada by RCA Inc. from master recordings owned or controlled by RCA Corp.\n\nPrinted on Side B label:\n\u2117 1980 1981 RCA Limitee\nFabriqu\u00e9 et distribu\u00e9 au Canada par RCA Inc. \u00e0 l'aide d'enregistrements originaux propri\u00e9t\u00e9 ou sous controle de RCA Corp.\n\nPrinted on inner sleeve:\nNarrated by Peter Marinker (a member of the [a3931172])\nEngineered by:\nJohn Etchells at JAM.\nJohn Hudson and Brian Tench at Mayfair Sound.\nHugh Padgham at the Town House.\nAndy Jackson, Peter Walsh, Rake McKenna and Peter Smith at Utopia.\nSteve Rance and Graeme Jackson at Nova Suite.\nRik Walton at Workhouse.\nDave Hunt at Berry Street.\nDavid Baker at Odyssey.\nColin Thurston at Red Bus.\nLandscape at Southern Studios.\nCutting Engineer: ...at Utopia\n\n\nSide headers only appear on inner sleeve in this release.\nDuration listed for A4a is for A4a and A4b combined\nCutting Engineer does not apply to this release which was cut by George Graves at McClear Place\nOn side B except is misspelled as \"ecxept\"",
